# --- Meridian runtime data ---
# Markdown under KNOWLEDGE_BASE_PATH is the source of truth and normally lives
# outside this repo; these cover local/dev copies so a real instance's data
# never gets committed by accident.
meridian.db
meridian.db-*
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
chroma/
.chroma/
*.chroma

